/-!
# Per-datum binders and ground-propagation round licences

The direct row-labelled step conservatively embeds the shared-row construction.
Schematic payload identity, occurrence regions, local activation soundness and
derivation uniformity are separate contracts. Ground propagation supplies exact
stages, finite closure depth and round lower bounds under both named ask timings.

The existing completed-outcome/support theorems below are reused, not reproved.
Their observer is not raw multiplicity, chronology or divergence. Actual
principal-settled finite application runs characterize derivability through the
protected source interpretation. Separate laws construct one coherent execution
whose finite pair-round prefixes are exactly the logical stages and whose limit
is DTL derivability, including unresolved callers. Its selected semantic policy
idles at a fixed reading set; it is not a native guard oracle or raw bag
termination theorem. Full-context capture has a checked exponential list-length
counterexample even at fixed readings. Independent direct and held read executions
agree on complete live views over arbitrary frames wherever the held
representation is available. Generic scope reassociation derives both directions
of the freshness and admission correspondence without global assignment
inhabitance. A protected two-stage protocol has an explicit bijection of
trace witnesses; its pending phase excludes unrelated public actions. Fresh
names alone do not provide that private capability contract, and primitive
chronological observations still distinguish the expansion.
-/

